flowchart TD
  A[Keyboard or on-screen button] --> B{Session active and not paused?}
  B -->|No| C[Ignore gameplay action]
  B -->|Yes| D{Requested action}
  D -->|Arrow Left / Left button| E[Clamp player left]
  D -->|Arrow Right / Right button| F[Clamp player right]
  D -->|Arrow Up / Space / Jump button| G[Restart jump animation]
